  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8376158d90edb1f0",
      "translationZh": "这是一个 llama.cpp 分支，旨在解决智能体循环中一种常见的开销：相同的大段内容被反复发送。一个文件可能在十轮之后被再次读取，或者某个工具再次返回相同的输出，而每一份副本都会留在上下文中，并经过预填充处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e845177c109ff8e9",
      "translationZh": "这个分支在 llama-server 的聊天解析器中增加了一道处理步骤。当后续消息与同一角色的一条较早消息在字节层面完全相同，且大小超过阈值时，后续副本就会被替换为一行引用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cacd7dc27e3208e0",
      "translationZh": "[重复内容已省略：与工具结果 #3 (read_file) 在字节层面完全相同，该结果以 \"...\" 开头；自那时起未发生变化]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15bf9cab1d59c12e",
      "translationZh": "第一份副本始终完整保留。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70d4e1f65b9f5b62",
      "translationZh": "默认关闭。关闭时，渲染后的提示词与上游版本在字节层面完全相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40053c25cbcd4273",
      "translationZh": "无状态且具有确定性。较早的轮次每次都以相同方式渲染，因此提示词缓存能持续命中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02cbbdf056e5f888",
      "translationZh": "可配置。使用 --message-dedup 启用，通过 --message-dedup-min-bytes 和 --message-dedup-roles 调整，或者在单次请求中设置 message_dedup 字段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e079c8849acd7f6",
      "translationZh": "有测量数据。响应计时信息会报告 dedup_n、dedup_bytes_saved 和 dedup_tokens_saved_est。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0894edccbc57a1d8",
      "translationZh": "它附带一套评测套件，包含 15 个合成的智能体场景，每个场景分别在关闭和开启去重的情况下运行，每组运行两次。所有在关闭去重时通过的场景，在开启去重时也都通过。在较重的场景中，提示词大小显著下降：一个场景从 18,092 → 6,820 个 token，另一个从 108,197 → 71,697 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e71a4e8a0b355a7",
      "translationZh": "局限：它只能识别完全重复的内容，无法识别近似重复的内容；端到端实际耗时的加速效果尚未进行基准测试，目前只统计了 token 数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d97d3602ec1978c",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/llopresto87",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4256dceab0d6ee6d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Odd_Cauliflower_8004 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
